I was thinking about Sokoban last night.  I enjoy this part of the
game, but I wish that there were more puzzles to add a bit of variety.
I started thinking about other mini-games that could be included and
came up with Theseus and the Minotaur.

There's  Java implementation at http://tinyurl.com/afuul.

This would suffer from similar problems to Sokoban unless a decent
number of levels were included.  However, it's a fun challenge.
Perhaps this type of puzzle could exist on one layer of Sokoban in
order to break the monotony of pushing boulders around?

Clearly meeting the minotaur would have to not result in instant death.
 Perhaps it could simply bump you back to the previous level?  Or
levelport you?

